			<attribute key="label" type="String">This is correct answer. "4 5" is not a valid input. In a train with 4 coaches, there cannot be a 5th coach. In other words, i will always be less than or equal to n. This is not explicitly mentioned in the problem. This is something we deduce using our common sense.</attribute>
