			</section>
			<section name="LabelGraphics">
				<attribute key="text" type="String">While trying to understand the input and output format, we also saw a few test cases. Based on those, please come up with 3 new test cases.</attribute>
				<attribute key="fontSize" type="int">12</attribute>
				<attribute key="fontName" type="String">Dialog</attribute>
