		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">18</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following are some hints for coming up with new test cases.

1. Normal test cases
1.1. n is greater than 1 and i is some value between 2 and (n-1)

2. Boundary test cases
2.1. n is greater than 1 and i is 1
2.2. n is greater than 1 and i is same as n
2.3. n is 1 and i is 1

Based on these hints, you can come up with at least 4 new test cases.
Write them on a paper along with the expected output.</attribute>
